{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A wall clock over the turn counter: a game where it is twenty to six, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ten to six four turns later."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/Text"],"title":"Structures"},{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/init(startingAt:minutesPerTurn:format:text:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/actions","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/day","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/format","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/minutesPerTurn","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/now","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/start","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/statusFields","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/verbs"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/advance(by:)","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/at(_:named:perform:)","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/location(of:)","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/location(of:at:)","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/pause()","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/resume()","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/GameContent-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GnustoClock"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Clock"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Clock"}],"externalID":"s:11GnustoClock0B0V","title":"Clock","symbolKind":"struct"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"The-clock","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/Text"],"title":"The clock"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Clock"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"derived, not ticked"}]},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"now"},{"type":"text","text":" is a pure function of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engine’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"moves"},{"type":"text","text":" counter, which means every rule, action, fuse and daemon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a turn reads the same time — including the timer tick at the end of it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A clock advanced by its own daemon would instead be read differently by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"daemons sorting before and after it in the tick order, making the time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depend on other timers’ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"names"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Deriving also inherits the engine’s notion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of world time for free: the clock already doesn’t move on a parse error or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a meta command, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take all"},{"type":"text","text":" already costs one turn, not four."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let clock = Clock(startingAt: TimeOfDay(17, 30), minutesPerTurn: 2)","","var content: GameContents { clock }        \/\/ registers the verb and the state","var timers: [TimedEvent] {","    clock.at(TimeOfDay(17, 46), named: \"blast\") {","        say(\"The carriage house goes up with a sound like a door slamming in a cave.\")","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"now"},{"type":"text","text":" needs a live turn, so it belongs in rule bodies, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"describe"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"blocks and actions — not in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"map"},{"type":"text","text":" block, which is evaluated at bootstrap."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not provided: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wait until <time>"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"text","text":" The parser has no numeric slot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires every token to be consumed, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wait until 8 15"},{"type":"text","text":" can never match a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pattern; and jumping the clock inside one turn would run a single timer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tick, silently skipping any alarm in between. Waiting a named number of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turns is the honest version, and the engine already does it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/location(of:at:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/location(of:at:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"location"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimeOfDay","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimeOfDayV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a timetable puts its actor at a given time — the question a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mystery is made of."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/location(of:at:)","title":"location(of:at:)"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/set(to:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/set(to:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimeOfDayV","text":"TimeOfDay","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Moves the clock "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"forward","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to the next occurrence of a time, at or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after now. Setting it to the current time does nothing; setting it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an earlier one lands tomorrow, so the day count never runs backwards."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)","title":"set(to:)"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameContent":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContent"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gamecontent","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A self-contained slice of a game’s world: its own rooms, items, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" state, plus the geography, rules, and verbs that go with them."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContent"}],"title":"GameContent","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/resume()":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resume"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/resume()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Restarts a paused clock from the time it stopped at. A no-op if it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already running.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/resume()","title":"resume()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","t